      "updated": 1777710280974,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> ye direct transmission of data from app to\ndistant child is not possible.\n-> Ab ye props drilling low level ki apps mein\ntoh chal jaati hai lekin mid ya high level\napplication mein -> it is worst.\n-> kyuki props drilling increases complexity\nso we have to use some optimed way\nto achieve this direct transmission of\nthe data from parent to any distant\nchild. -> we use centralised approach ",
      "fontSize": 18.235977365119506,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> ye direct transmission of data from app to\ndistant child is not possible.\n-> Ab ye props drilling low level ki apps mein\ntoh chal jaati hai lekin mid ya high level\napplication mein -> it is worst.\n-> kyuki props drilling increases complexity\nso we have to use some optimed way\nto achieve this direct transmission of\nthe data from parent to any distant\nchild. -> we use centralised approach ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
