      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777788693987,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Context API's -> We need 3 things.\n1. Context - create the context.\n2. Provider - provide the data to context.\n3. useContext - use the data from the context that you had created.\n\nHum App ko context component se wrap kar demge -> ye karne ke baad hume\nApp nahi context component dikhega",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Context API's -> We need 3 things.\n1. Context - create the context.\n2. Provider - provide the data to context.\n3. useContext - use the data from the context that you had created.\n\nHum App ko context component se wrap kar demge -> ye karne ke baad hume\nApp nahi context component dikhega",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
